    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "小白龙在水中窥看岸上人间的众生相（欢乐与哀愁、各样衣着表情），生出强烈渴望：她要去了解一个人，去探知他的心。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000014.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000014",
          "chapter_order": 14,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "她忽然有一种强烈的渴望，她要去了解一个人，去探知他的心。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "小白龙沿岸打量每个人，最终只注意到河边一个光头和尚，原因是他的眼睛——他看草木、柳树、街上行人的目光温暖愉悦，像太阳一样在欣赏和赞美。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000014.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000014",
          "chapter_order": 14,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "是了，因为他的眼睛。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "岸上有女子冲那和尚喊「那和尚！你盯着人家女孩子家看干吗？色迷迷的！讨厌！」，围观的人也都骂他「花痴和尚」。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000014.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000014",
          "chapter_order": 14,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "色迷迷的！讨厌！"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "那和尚被骂并不生气，笑着答道：「你入我眼，如花映水中，便不是花，色本是空，万物皆为红尘。」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "河边和尚"
      },
      "revealed_at": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000014.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000014",
          "chapter_order": 14,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "色本是空，万物皆为红尘"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "小白龙迫不及待想游到岸边让和尚看自己，因为她所化的是少见的纯金色鲤鱼，料想和尚一定会赞美她。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000014.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000014",
          "chapter_order": 14,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "和尚一定会赞美她的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "小白龙游过去时被水中之物缠住，随即被提出水面；一名船夫大喊自己抓到了纯金色的鲤鱼，招呼众人来看。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000014.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000014",
          "chapter_order": 14,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我抓了一条什么？金色的鲤鱼！纯金色的！"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "小白龙被擒后觉得被一个「俗物」所擒又羞又气，想变化脱身，但离了水就失了神通。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000014.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000014",
          "chapter_order": 14,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "她想要变化，但没了水她就失了神通。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-8",
      "text": "围观人群为这条金色鲤鱼争相加价，起价「我要买它，十文钱！」，随后有人出十一文、十二文，船夫称这是「一辈子也不一定能见到一条」的稀罕物。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
